# W4-OPENING-1: the opening's controls through the production window (real SDL events), from the
# ship-start launch: the adapter controls and one short voyage. Launch:
#   --ship-start data/maps/candidates/ship-start-v2/lan5-ship-a.json --seat 0 --speed 200
# No command is made by anything but the pointer and the keys below.
wait frames 20
expect fact cities == 0
expect fact gold == 30000
expect fact selected == none
expect fact tracked == 0
expect fact tool == off
# 1. Another participant's ship can be inspected, never ordered or stopped.
lookw 652 680
wait frames 20
pick-ship 4
expect fact selected == 4
sail 652 664
key h
wait turns 3
expect fact tracked == 0
expect title inspect only
# 2. Back to our own ship (seat 0, figure 1). A pan is not an order: a right drag and a left drag.
lookw 312 680
wait frames 20
pick-ship 1
expect fact selected == 1
pan 80 0
lpan 60 0
wait turns 2
expect fact tracked == 0
expect fact selected == 1
# 3. A cancelled press is not an order: focus lost, and Esc, between the press and the release.
lookw 312 680
wait frames 20
rdown 312 664
focus-lost
rup 312 664
rdown 312 664
key esc
rup 312 664
wait turns 2
expect fact tracked == 0
expect fact selected == 1
# 4. Land is not a target (the island's coast is far away: look there, order the land tile).
lookw 255 138
wait frames 20
sail 255 138
wait turns 2
expect fact tracked == 0
expect title land
lookw 312 680
wait frames 20
# 5. A real order: acceptance, then arrival, each by its own order id.
sail 312 664
wait turns 2
expect fact latest_kind == move
wait fact latest == arrived within 60000
expect fact ship.1.x == 312
expect fact ship.1.y == 664
expect fact tracked.0.state == arrived
# 6. A second order replaces nothing that arrived: the first order's arrival is not its arrival.
sail 312 640
wait turns 3
expect fact tracked == 2
expect fact tracked.0.state == arrived
expect fact latest != arrived
expect fact latest_kind == move
key h
wait turns 3
expect fact tracked == 3
expect fact tracked.1.state == stopped
expect fact tracked.2.kind == stop
expect fact ship.1.order == 0
quit
